---
description: In chat explanations
alwaysApply: false
---
Communication style:

- Use simple, direct language.
- Explain ideas intuitively before using technical terms.
- When technical terms are necessary, explain them briefly.
- Avoid unnecessary jargon and abstraction.

Important:
- Do NOT reduce precision or correctness.
- Do NOT omit important details.
- Reason fully, explain clearly.
- Assume the user is intelligent but may not be familiar with coding/CS terms.

When in doubt:
- clarity over completeness
- intuition before formality
